{"seq":1,"slug":"cjk-prefix-suggest","title":"CJK 无空格前缀建议与拼音别名索引","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-autocomplete-suggestion/multilingual-suggest/cjk-prefix-suggest","wordCount":2900,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"cjk-无空格前缀建议与拼音别名索引\">CJK 无空格前缀建议与拼音别名索引</h1><p>在英文搜索框里，前缀是一个可靠的概念：用户敲的字符序列一定是最终查询的前缀。在中文、日文、韩文搜索框里这个概念立刻崩塌。用户敲 <code>pg</code> 两个拉丁字母，最终执行的是 <code>苹果手机</code> —— <code>pg</code> 既不是 <code>苹果手机</code> 的字符前缀，也不是它的拼音前缀（拼音全拼是 <code>pingguo</code>）。如果建议索引只按文本前缀建，这个用户在看到任何候选之前就已经被抛弃了。</p>\n<p>这就是 CJK 建议的核心难题：<strong>输入形态与查询形态之间不是前缀关系，而是一个多对多的映射</strong>。用户可能敲汉字（<code>苹</code>）、全拼（<code>pingguo</code>）、拼音首字母（<code>pg</code>）、注音（台湾市场的 <code>ㄆㄧㄥˊ</code>）、粤拼（香港市场）、或者手写识别出的候选字。一个成熟的 CJK 建议索引必须为同一个查询维护多个&quot;输入别名&quot;，并让别名之间的前缀查询共享同一份热度排序。本文讲这套别名索引的构建、歧义抑制与输入法中间态处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-别名字典是-cjk-建议的地基\">核心概念：别名字典是 CJK 建议的地基</h2><p>把&quot;用户敲什么&quot;与&quot;索引里存什么&quot;分开，问题就变得可解。为每条查询 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 生成一组别名 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(q) = \\{a_1, a_2, \\dots\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，索引构建在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>⋃</mo><mi>q</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bigcup_q \\{(a, q)\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">⋃</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0017em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">{(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)}</span></span></span></span></span> 上；查询时用户输入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，在别名集合里做前缀查找，命中的别名把分数传给它对应的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><mtext>norm</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>pinyin</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>initials</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>zhuyin</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>jyutping</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(q) = \\{\\, \\text{norm}(q),\\; \\text{pinyin}(q),\\; \\text{initials}(q),\\; \\text{zhuyin}(q),\\; \\text{jyutping}(q) \\,\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">norm</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pinyin</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">initials</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">zhuyin</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">jyutping</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <code>initials</code> 是把每个汉字的拼音首字母连起来（<code>苹果手机</code> → <code>pgsj</code>），<code>pinyin</code> 是连写全拼（<code>pingguoshouji</code>）。这样 <code>pg</code> 命中 <code>pgsj</code> 的前缀，<code>ping</code> 命中 <code>pingguoshouji</code> 的前缀，<code>苹</code> 命中 <code>norm</code> 的前缀，三条路径都归到 <code>苹果手机</code>。（全拼与&quot;首字母缩写&quot;是拼音输入法的两种标准输入方式，例如 <code>yyh</code> 可代替 <code>yinyuehui</code>，来源：Wikipedia, Pinyin input method, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pinyin_input_method\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pinyin_input_method</a>）</p>\n<p>不同语言体系下的&quot;前缀&quot;语义差异极大，这张表是设计索引前的必要功课：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>输入模型</th>\n<th>前缀语义</th>\n<th>索引别名形态</th>\n<th>主要歧义来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>英语</td>\n<td>直接键入</td>\n<td>字符前缀，几乎唯一</td>\n<td>归一化文本</td>\n<td>拼写错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中文</td>\n<td>IME 拼音/首字母/手写/注音</td>\n<td>音节前缀 + 首字母序列</td>\n<td>文本、全拼、首字母、注音</td>\n<td>同音字、首字母碰撞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日语</td>\n<td>IME 罗马字→假名→汉字</td>\n<td>假名序列前缀（未确定态）</td>\n<td>平假名、罗马字、汉字</td>\n<td>同音汉字极多</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>韩语</td>\n<td>字母组合成音节</td>\n<td>谚文音节前缀 + 字母态</td>\n<td>谚文、韩文罗马字</td>\n<td>组合中间态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阿拉伯语</td>\n<td>直接键入（RTL）</td>\n<td>字符前缀但方向相反</td>\n<td>去变音符文本</td>\n<td>变音符与书写变体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>泰语</td>\n<td>直接键入</td>\n<td>可能切断词（无空格）</td>\n<td>字符前缀 + 词边界切分</td>\n<td>无词边界的歧义</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注音（Bopomofo / Zhuyin）是台湾市场的主流输入与标注体系，自 1945 年起在台湾使用；粤拼（Jyutping）是香港语言学学会于 1993 年发布的粤语罗马化方案（来源：Wikipedia, Bopomofo, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bopomofo\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bopomofo</a>；Wikipedia, Jyutping, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jyutping\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jyutping</a>）。</p>\n<p>日语与韩语那两行说明问题不止于中文：<strong>输入法未确定态</strong>是 CJK 系的通用难题。日语用户敲 <code>りんご</code> 时，输入法还没把假名转成汉字 <code>林檎</code>，此时搜索框里显示的就是假名序列；韩语用户敲第三个字母时，音节可能还没组合完整。建议服务必须能接受这些中间态输入，而不是假设输入是&quot;合法的最终文本&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;用户输入&lt;br/&gt;苹 / ping / pg / ㄆ&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;脚本检测&lt;br/&gt;script run 切分&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;归一化&lt;br/&gt;大小写/全半角/繁简&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;别名生成&lt;br/&gt;谐音/首字母/注音/粤拼&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;别名前缀索引&lt;br/&gt;FST over aliases&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;命中查询集合&lt;br/&gt;含歧义候选&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;热度先验加权&lt;br/&gt;freq + trend&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;歧义抑制&lt;br/&gt;同音/首字母碰撞消解&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; I[&quot;建议候选&lt;br/&gt;每组别名各自打分&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; J[&quot;跨别名去重&lt;br/&gt;按 query_norm 合并&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"用户输入&lt;br/&gt;苹 / ping / pg / ㄆ\"] --&gt; B[\"脚本检测&lt;br/&gt;script run 切分\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"归一化&lt;br/&gt;大小写/全半角/繁简\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"别名生成&lt;br/&gt;谐音/首字母/注音/粤拼\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"别名前缀索引&lt;br/&gt;FST over aliases\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"命中查询集合&lt;br/&gt;含歧义候选\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"热度先验加权&lt;br/&gt;freq + trend\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"歧义抑制&lt;br/&gt;同音/首字母碰撞消解\"]\n    H --&gt; I[\"建议候选&lt;br/&gt;每组别名各自打分\"]\n    I --&gt; J[\"跨别名去重&lt;br/&gt;按 query_norm 合并\"]</pre><p>注意 <code>E</code> 到 <code>F</code> 那一步的输出是&quot;一组查询&quot;，而不是&quot;一条查询&quot;。<code>pg</code> 会命中 <code>苹果手机</code>、<code>皮革包</code>、<code>排骨</code>、<code>PG 游戏本</code>……这正是下一节要处理的歧义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"首字母缩写的歧义爆炸与热度先验\">首字母缩写的歧义爆炸与热度先验</h2><p>首字母别名是 CJK 建议里性价比最高的功能（用户少敲 80% 的键），也是最容易被噪声淹没的功能。因为它的碰撞率是组合级的：两个汉字的首字母有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>26</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>676</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">26^2 = 676</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">676</span></span></span></span></span> 种组合，三个汉字 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>26</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>17576</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">26^3 = 17576</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">17576</span></span></span></span></span> 种。任何一条两字母输入都会命中大量查询。</p>\n<p>处理办法不是&quot;提高阈值&quot;（那会把长尾正确项一起杀掉），而是<strong>用热度先验做条件概率排序</strong>。设用户输入前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，候选查询 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∝</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(q \\mid p) \\propto P(p \\mid q) \\cdot P(q)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(p \\mid q)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是别名生成模型——在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 的正确别名集合里，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 是否是其前缀（命中则为 1，否则为 0，或者用别名类型加权：精确文本前缀 &gt; 全拼前缀 &gt; 首字母前缀）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(q)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是查询先验，来自 <code>freq_7d</code> 或融合了趋势的分数。于是排序退化为&quot;在命中集合里按热度取 top-K&quot;，而热度恰好是我们已经有的东西。</p>\n<p>三个工程细节决定这个方案的成败：</p>\n<p><strong>别名类型必须加权，而不是等价。</strong> 用户输 <code>苹果</code>（汉字）时，他几乎确定要的是含&quot;苹果&quot;的查询，此时不该让 <code>pg 游戏本</code>（首字母别名恰好是 <code>pg</code>）挤进来。因此别名类型进入分数：汉字前缀命中给权重 1.0，全拼命中给 0.6，首字母命中给 0.3，注音/粤拼命中给 0.5。这些权重是可实验参数，不是拍脑袋常量。</p>\n<p><strong>首字母别名的长度下限。</strong> 单字母输入（<code>p</code>）触发首字母匹配会产生不可用的噪声，因此首字母别名只在输入长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 时启用。同理，全拼别名在输入长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 时启用（<code>pi</code> 命中 <code>pingguo</code> 意义不大，但 <code>pin</code> 开始有意义）。这是一个&quot;梯度触发&quot;策略，不同别名类型有不同的最短触发长度。</p>\n<p><strong>多音字与儿化音。</strong> <code>重庆</code> 的拼音是 <code>chongqing</code> 而非 <code>zhongqing</code>，<code>银行</code> 是 <code>yinhang</code> 而非 <code>xinhang</code>。把多音字按常用读音全拼生成会导致 <code>cq</code> 命不中 <code>重庆</code>。可行方案是对高频多音字词做人工词典覆盖（规模可控，几千条），而不是试图用规则解决——多音字的正确读音依赖词而非字，这是分词问题，不是别名问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"输入法中间态-假名-谚文与罗马字\">输入法中间态：假名、谚文与罗马字</h2><p>日韩输入法的未确定态需要单独的处理路径，因为它们的&quot;中间态&quot;不是合法查询的前缀，而是<strong>另一种书写系统的暂时表示</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>日语。</strong> 用户敲罗马字 <code>ringo</code>，输入法先给出平假名 <code>りんご</code>，按空格才转成 <code>林檎</code>。在建议服务看来，搜索框里传上来的是 <code>りんご</code>。因此日语建议索引必须同时维护<strong>假名别名</strong>和<strong>汉字原文</strong>：<code>林檎</code> 的假名别名是 <code>りんご</code>，用户输入 <code>りんご</code> 命中它，展示时返回 <code>林檎</code>（或&quot;りんご / 林檎&quot;双写）。日语同音字极多（<code>こうしょう</code> 对应几十个不同汉字词），因此日语的歧义比中文更严重，热度先验的权重需要更高。</p>\n<p><strong>韩语。</strong> 韩语字母（jamo）组合成音节，<code>ㅎ</code> + <code>ㅏ</code> + <code>ㄴ</code> → <code>한</code>。用户逐键输入时，最后一个音节可能处于部分组合态。正确处理是把输入先按 jamo 序列规范化再匹配，即索引里同时存谚文音节别名与 jamo 分解别名：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"한국  →  jamo: ㅎㅏㄴㄱㅜㄱ\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>한국  →  jamo: ㅎㅏㄴㄱㅜㄱ</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这样无论用户处于组合的哪个中间态，都能被 jamo 别名接住。这与 Unicode 的 Hangul 分解规则（conjoining jamo）一致，实现上应直接用 Unicode 规范分解（NFD 的 Hangul 部分），而不是自己写组合算法（来源：UAX #15 Unicode Normalization Forms——Hangul 音节到 conjoining jamo 的分解属规范分解、且实现为算法而非查表, <a href=\"https://www.unicode.org/reports/tr15/\">https://www.unicode.org/reports/tr15/</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>罗马字输入。</strong> 日语罗马字有多套体系（Hepburn <code>shinbun</code>、Kunrei <code>sinbun</code>、Nihon <code>sinnbun</code>），用户可能用任意一套（三套体系对 <code>し/つ/ふ</code> 分别写作 <code>shi/si</code>、<code>tsu/tu</code>、<code>fu/hu</code>，来源：Wikipedia, Romanization of Japanese, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Romanization_of_Japanese\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Romanization_of_Japanese</a>）。做法是把常用 query 的罗马字别名生成多套，或者在匹配时做罗马字规范化（把 <code>si</code>/<code>shi</code>、<code>tu</code>/<code>tsu</code>、<code>hu</code>/<code>fu</code> 归并到同一规范形式）。后者更省空间。</p>\n<p>这三类中间态处理的共同结论是：<strong>在确定态之前就给出建议，价值最高也最难做</strong>。价值高是因为用户在打字过程中就已经在等待候选；难做是因为输入不是&quot;文本&quot;而是一个状态快照，索引必须以更宽的等价类来接住它。</p>\n<h2 id=\"索引规模与内存预算\">索引规模与内存预算</h2><p>别名索引的代价是条目数膨胀。以中文为例，每条查询平均生成 3-4 个别名（文本、全拼、首字母、注音），条目数放大 3-4 倍；再加上 FST 的共享前缀压缩（拼音别名之间有大量公共前缀，压缩率通常 5-10 倍），最终内存占用与原文索引同阶。做一个量级估算：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>项</th>\n<th>量级</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>查询数（单市场）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>过质量闸门后的有效查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平均别名数</td>\n<td>3.5</td>\n<td>文本 + 全拼 + 首字母（+ 注音/粤拼按市场）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>别名总条目</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3.5</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3.5 \\times 10^6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>未压缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FST 压缩率</td>\n<td>5-10x</td>\n<td>拼音别名公共前缀极多</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单市场内存</td>\n<td>数十 MB</td>\n<td>全内存可容纳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分市场副本</td>\n<td>市场数 ×</td>\n<td>但市场间可共享原始 FST 段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键工程结论：<strong>CJK 的别名索引仍然可以全内存、可以做边缘下沉</strong>，这与英文索引的结论一致。膨胀倍数（3-4x）在百万级查询规模下不构成架构障碍，因此不需要为 CJK 单独设计一套分布式索引——它和英文走同一条<a href=\"../low-latency/edge-suggest\">边缘加速</a>路径，只是索引文件更大。</p>\n<p>但有一个必须提前决定的问题：<strong>别名的生成发生在离线索引构建期还是在线查询期</strong>。离线生成（把别名烧进索引）查询快、索引大、更新慢；在线生成（构建时只存原文，查询时展开别名再匹配）索引小、更新快、查询慢。CJK 场景推荐离线生成——因为别名生成依赖拼音词典与多音字表，这份词典本身就要人工维护，放在离线管道里变更可控；在线生成会让每次查询都跑一遍拼音转换，把 30ms 预算吃掉一大块。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CJK 的核心难题是输入形态与查询形态之间不是前缀关系，因此必须引入&quot;别名&quot;层，把前缀查询建在别名字典上。</li>\n<li>别名集合通常包含归一化文本、全拼、首字母、注音、粤拼；不同别名类型有不同权重与不同的最短触发长度。</li>\n<li>首字母别名的碰撞率是组合级的（两汉字 676 种），必须用热度先验 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∝</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(q \\mid p) \\propto P(p \\mid q)P(q)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 做条件排序，而不是靠提高阈值。</li>\n<li>多音字（<code>重庆</code>/<code>重庆</code>）依赖词而非字，用高频词人工词典覆盖比规则推导可靠。</li>\n<li>日语与韩语的难点是输入法未确定态：日语要维护假名别名、韩语要按 Unicode jamo 分解匹配；日语罗马字需先规范化（<code>si</code>/<code>shi</code> 归并）。</li>\n<li>别名索引的空间膨胀约 3-4 倍，FST 压缩后单市场仍在数十 MB 量级，因此 CJK 与英文走同一条边缘下沉路径，无需独立架构。</li>\n<li>别名生成推荐在离线索引构建期完成（依赖拼音词典与多音字表，变更可控），在线只做前缀匹配。</li>\n<li>下一步：混文字与拉丁化输入的恢复见<a href=\"mixed-input-suggest\">混语言输入与拉丁拼写建议</a>；输入处于中间态且拼错时如何给出纠错建议见<a href=\"typo-suggest\">边输边纠错建议</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CJK 无空格前缀建议与拼音别名索引","id":"cjk-无空格前缀建议与拼音别名索引"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：别名字典是 CJK 建议的地基","id":"核心概念-别名字典是-cjk-建议的地基"},{"level":2,"text":"首字母缩写的歧义爆炸与热度先验","id":"首字母缩写的歧义爆炸与热度先验"},{"level":2,"text":"输入法中间态：假名、谚文与罗马字","id":"输入法中间态-假名-谚文与罗马字"},{"level":2,"text":"索引规模与内存预算","id":"索引规模与内存预算"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"商品建议与查询词建议的混合编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-autocomplete-suggestion/suggestion-types/product-query-suggest"},"next":{"title":"混语言输入、音译恢复与拉丁拼写建议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-autocomplete-suggestion/multilingual-suggest/mixed-input-suggest"}}